# FOUNDRY — STAGE 3: DATA INTELLIGENCE & GOOGLE INTEGRATIONS

## PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Transform Foundry into a connected, data-aware AI workspace by implementing a shared database, Knowledge Base engine, document extraction system, RAG engine, persistent AI memory, and Google Workspace integrations.

Complete Phases 12–24 in dependency order.

Preserve the existing Foundry whiteboard, Education Controller, floating application panels, Window Manager, Application Registry, Communication Bridge, AI Chat interface, and local Ollama integration.

Ollama must remain the primary AI engine.

Google Workspace should function as an authorized information and productivity layer, not as a replacement AI engine.

