Account: Not connected

[ Connect Google Account ]

Authorized Services
─────────────────────────
Google Drive
Google Docs
Google Slides
Google Sheets
Google Calendar
Google Tasks
Google Forms
Google Classroom
```

Each service must display its real authorization and connection status.

